  "view": "Mixed quarter. Billings grew 12.8% to ₹822.3 crore, but the stock fell 3% on Shiksha's 27.2% decline and a recruitment growth rate that trails pure-play SaaS peers. 99acres at 21.2% and matchmaking at 23.1% are the offsets. AI search is eating Shiksha's referral traffic, and the market is pricing that risk.",
