  "view": "Mixed news. The Jio IPO is moving forward, with reports of a Rs 37,700 crore issue and valuation talk of $110-140 billion. Airtel's tariff hike (Rs 50 on postpaid) gives Jio room to raise prices, but Jio says it will stay the most affordable. Jio's ARPU is Rs 215.6, still below Airtel's Rs 264. The IPO is the main event; the tariff stance is a near-term margin question.",
