      "essay": "Flipkart's festive sale is undercutting Amazon on some devices and losing on others. The iPhone 17 256GB is down to Rs 84,999 on Flipkart, with an additional Rs 5,000 ICICI Bank discount bringing the effective price to Rs 79,999, according to Source 5. On laptops, Flipkart lists the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 at Rs 1,19,990 versus Amazon's Rs 1,51,490, a Rs 31,500 gap, and the MacBook Air 13-inch M5 at Rs 1,64,990 versus Amazon's Rs 1,72,490, a Rs 7,500 gap. Amazon wins on the HP OmniBook 3 at Rs 57,990 versus Flipkart's Rs 71,784, a Rs 13,794 difference, and on the Lenovo Yoga Slim 7 Aura Edition at Rs 1,12,990 versus Flipkart's Rs 1,19,199, a Rs 6,209 gap. Source 1 notes that listed prices don't always reflect the final amount payable after bank and exchange offers. Flipkart also has the LG 55UR7500 55-inch 4K TV at Rs 35,899, down from Rs 71,990, per Source 3. For a platform betting on festive volume, the iPhone and TV deals are the volume drivers, while laptop pricing shows it can't win everywhere.",
